<title>UK: Wet Brent cargo trades at August -60 cents.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent cargo trades at August -60 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A dated Brent cargo loading June 26-28 traded at August Brent -60 cents on Tuesday from a trader to a European major, players said.</p>
<p>The deal was slightly below numbers done on Monday, which reflected the relative promptness of the cargo, traders said. Monday's deals were said to be at August Brent -55 cents.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
